[{"name":"mcp__codex_apps__booking_com_accommodations_search_v2","description":"Find all best stays and more.

Use this when the user wants to find, search, view or compare different accommodation types for their trip, for example, hotels, hostels, apartments, homes, guest houses, lodging, chalets, amongst many more. The user can find accommodations by destination, dates, number of nights, guests, budget, landmarks, and/or facilities (e.g., pool, parking, free breakfast, gym, all‑inclusive, family‑friendly). When the user asks to check or compare specific hotels by name, use hotel_names instead of destination. LLM must provide a city, coordinates, or hotel_names. Returns available accommodation options with price, photos, guest ratings, and facilities.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__codex_apps__booking_com_accommodations_search_v2(args: { accommodation_types?: Array<"HOTEL" | "APARTMENT" | "GUEST_HOUSE" | "BED_AND_BREAKFAST" | "HOLIDAY_HOME" | "RESORT" | "HOSTEL" | "VILLA">; checkin_date: string; checkout_date: string; children_ages?: Array<number>; coordinates?: { latitude: number; longitude: number; radius: number; }; currency?: string; destination?: string; facilities?: Array<"PARKING" | "FREE_PARKING" | "SPA_AND_WELLNESS_CENTRE" | "SWIMMING_POOL" | "TWENTY_FOUR_HOUR_FRONT_DESK" | "RESTAURANT" | "FITNESS_CENTRE" | "AIRPORT_SHUTTLE" | "AIRPORT_DROP_OFF" | "FREE_WIFI" | "PETS_ALLOWED" | "NON_SMOKING_ROOMS" | "FAMILY_ROOMS" | "WHEELCHAIR_ACCESSIBLE" | "ELECTRIC_VEHICLE_CHARGING_STATION" | "ROOM_SERVICE" | "BEACH" | "BEACHFRONT" | "BBQ_FACILITIES" | "ADULTS_ONLY" | "GARDEN" | "EXPRESS_CHECK_IN_CHECK_OUT" | "HOT_TUB_JACUZZI" | "DESIGNATED_SMOKING_AREA" | "AIR_CONDITIONING" | "SKIING" | "SAUNA">; hotel_names?: Array<string>; image_themes?: Array<"RESTAURANT_COMMON_DINING_AREA" | "KITCHEN_OR_KITCHENETTE" | "COFFEE_TEA_FACILITIES" | "BED" | "GARDEN_GARDEN_VIEW" | "BALCONY_TERRACE" | "SWIMMING_POOL" | "NATURAL_LANDSCAPE" | "BEACH" | "CITY_VIEW" | "MOUNTAIN_VIEW" | "RIVER_LAKE_VIEW" | "SEA_VIEW" | "SPA_WELLNESS_MASSAGE" | "GOLF" | "SKIING" | "CHILDREN_PLAYGROUND_OUTDOORS" | "AQUA_PARK" | "KIDS_CLUB_INDOORS" | "FOOD" | "BREAKFAST" | "JACUZZI_HOT_TUB" | "FIREPLACE" | "TWIN_BED_2_BEDS" | "OUTDOOR_SWIMMING_POOL" | "INDOOR_SWIMMING_POOL" | "ROOFTOP" | "ROMANCE">; meal_plan?: "breakfast_included" | "half_board" | "full_board" | "all_inclusive"; minimum_review_score?: number; number_of_adults?: number; number_of_rooms?: number; price?: { maximum?: number; minimum?: number; }; star_rating?: Array<number>; user_country_code: string; user_locale?: string; user_query?: string; view_mode?: "LIST" | "MAP"; [key: string]: unknown; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{
  // List of available accommodations with essential information
  accommodations: Array<{
  // The type of accommodation (e.g., hotel, apartment, vacation rental).
  accommodationType?: string;
