{"body":"## Summary\n\n- The sidebar becomes the single site map. Workspace level is Activity / Connect / Context; each agent expands to Behaviors, Skills, Guardrails and Settings. The agent workbench tab strip is deleted rather than duplicated there.\n- Model providers and sandboxes become first-class connectors through a read-layer union — an `inference-provider:` / `sandbox:` prefixed key is the routable connector key, so both render through the shared connector detail page instead of their own bespoke surfaces. Connect collapses to two tabs; `/infrastructure` and `/environments` fold away.\n- Context expands to the workspace's entity types with their record counts, so the schema is reachable without opening the map.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `make pre-pr` clean (build + typecheck + knip + lint + exposed-surface naming)\n- [x] Tests run: full owletto suite — **971 passed / 115 files**\n- [x] `bun run build` — SPA bundle check passed\n- [ ] Bug fix: red→fix→green (n/a — this is a refactor + feature branch)\n\nTwo new sidebar tests were mutation-tested. Breaking the search-param key (`type` → `entityType`) and hiding zero counts each make a test fail, so the assertions bite.\n\n## Notes\n\n**Entity map.** System types now get a solid dimmed border instead of a dashed one (dashes read as placeholder/unsaved, which these are not), the dot grid drops to /20 opacity, and unconnected types stack in a column instead of running off the right edge of the canvas.\n\n**Sandbox forms** now render the gateway runtime registry's declared credential fields (surfaced by `GET /sandboxes` in the paired lobu PR) instead of a hardcoded Vercel field list, so a second provider needs no frontend change.\n\n**Provider edit** no longer closes optimistically — it awaits its mutations and surfaces failures, and OAuth-only providers stop rendering base URL / model / key inputs they cannot use.\n\n**Dead code removed:** six unreferenced modules (`ai-elements/conversation`, `stats-strip` + test, the jsonforms renderer and the two editable-field schema helpers only it used, `mcp-install-targets`), freeing `@jsonforms/core`, `@jsonforms/react`, `framer-motion` and `use-stick-to-bottom`.\n\nDeliberately kept: `@tiptap/pm` (a required peer of `@tiptap/react`, never imported directly, so knip reports it unused), and the redirect-only `/inference-providers` and `/infrastructure/models` routes — chat messages already sent contain those links immutably.\n\nScreenshots: after-shots only, captured from the booted branch. Before-shots from a clean `origin/main` boot were skipped by agreement to avoid a second full install/boot cycle.\n\nPairs with the lobu PR that surfaces `credentialFields` and repoints the provider CTAs; merge this one **first**, then repoint the parent's submodule pointer.\n\n\u003c!-- codesmith:footer --\u003e\n---\n\u003ca href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/lobu-ai/codesmith/owletto/pr/614\"\u003e\u003cpicture\u003e\u003csource media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-dark-v2.svg\"\u003e\u003csource media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-light-v2.svg\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"View with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-dark-v2.svg\"\u003e\u003c/picture\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003csup\u003eNeed help on this PR? Tag \u003ccode\u003e@codesmith\u003c/code\u003e with what you need. Autofix is enabled.\u003c/sup\u003e\n\n\u003c!-- codesmith:autofix:enabled --\u003e\n\u003c!-- /codesmith:footer --\u003e","mergeCommit":"93a493ae168fe57df716cfb7d4ad547ca8e79c31","mergedAt":"2026-07-28T04:50:34Z","number":614,"title":"feat(web): make the sidebar the site map and fold providers/sandboxes into connectors"}

